      "text": [
        " عَلِيُّ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ اَلنَّوْفَلِيُّ لِأَبِي اَلْحَسَنِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : إِنِّي أَفْطَرْتُ يَوْمَ اَلْفِطْرِ عَلَى طِينِ اَلْقَبْرِ وَ تَمْرٍ فَقَالَ لَهُ «جَمَعْتَ بَيْنَ بَرَكَةٍ وَ سُنَّةٍ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2056 - Ali ibn Muhammad Al-Nawfali said to Imam Abu Al-Hasan (as):\n\"I broke my fast on the Day of Eid al-Fitr with the clay of the grave (Turbah) and dates.\"\nImam (as) replied: \"You have combined blessing and tradition (sunnah).\""
        ]
      }
